plantuml
@startuml
actor 用户 as User
participant "前端" as Frontend
participant "Flask后端" as Backend

User -> Frontend : 点击按钮
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend : HTTP请求(POST/GET)
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend : 处理请求逻辑
Backend -> Backend : 查询数据库/业务处理

Backend --> Frontend : JSON响应
deactivate Backend

Frontend --> User : 更新界面显示
deactivate Frontend

@enduml